    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">The Reporting Person forfeited 3,113 shares of common stock upon conversion of 7,384 vested and outstanding restricted stock units into shares of common stock to cover tax withholdings, using the market price of the Issuer's common stock at the time of forfeiture. These restricted stock units were part of the grant reported in Table I of the Form 4 filed by the Reporting Person with the Securities and Exchange Commission on March 20, 2023.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">Includes 113,763 unvested restricted stock units held by the Reporting Person, all of which remain subject to certain vesting conditions.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">On August 20, 2025 the Reporting Person transferred 4,271 shares of common stock to the James J. Ison Jr. &amp; Sha-Marie A Ison TR UA 06 04 2020 James J. Ison Jr. &amp; Shah-Marie A Ison Inter Vivos Revocable Trust (the &quot;Trust&quot;), of which the Reporting Person is trustee. The Reporting Person and members of his immediate family are the sole beneficiaries of the Trust.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">These shares are owned directly by the Trust, and indirectly by James Ison as trustee of the Trust.</footnote>
    </footnotes>

